<translate>
==== MaxRange ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for weapons. Sets the weapon's maximum attack range. Range affects the chance of hitting a target.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MaxRange = 1.55,
</syntaxhighlight>
